Package: CleanLASA
Title: Import and Clean LASA SPSS Data
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bram", "Hoogerheide", , "b.hoogerheide@vu.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for importing and cleaning data from the Longitudinal
    Aging Study Amsterdam (LASA). Detects the LASA file code and wave from
    a data file's name, applies variable and value labels from a bundled
    database transcribed from LASA documentation, harmonizes variable names
    and codes across waves, and reports variables that could not be matched
    to their documentation. Also reshapes LASA data between wide and long
    format with cohort-aware wave and time columns, searches LASA's topic
    index, and opens LASA's variable documentation.
